<p class="eyebrow">Officer desk</p>
<h1>Terms and semesters</h1>
<p class="lede">Terms decide which semester a member's points count toward. Keep a term covering today so the member chart can show current eligibility.</p>
<p>Current points automatically start at zero at midnight in America/Chicago on each term's start date. The end date includes the whole day. Attendance and adjustments stay in their original semester; no reset button or scheduled job is needed.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Review prior-semester reports", officer_csv_transfer_path, class: "text-link" %> by selecting a term or all time.</p>

<% unless @current_term %>
  <p class="alert" role="alert">No term covers today. Members see <strong>Current term unavailable</strong> until you add a term whose dates include today.</p>
<% end %>

<div class="toolbar">
  <%= link_to "Add a term", new_officer_term_path, class: "button" %>
</div>

<% if @terms.any? %>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="roster">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Term</th>
          <th scope="col">Dates</th>
          <th scope="col">Required points</th>
          <th scope="col">Category minimums</th>
          <th scope="col">Events</th>
          <th scope="col">Action</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <% @terms.each do |term| %>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <%= term.name %>
              <% if term == @current_term %><span class="when-chip">current</span><% end %>
            </td>
            <td class="mono"><%= term.starts_on.strftime("%Y-%m-%d") %> to <%= term.ends_on.strftime("%Y-%m-%d") %></td>
            <td class="mono"><%= term.required_points %></td>
            <td class="mono"><%= term.required_professional_points %> professional, <%= term.required_social_points %> social</td>
            <td class="mono"><%= term.events.count %></td>
            <td><%= link_to "Edit", edit_officer_term_path(term), class: "text-link" %></td>
          </tr>
        <% end %>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <section class="empty-board">
    <h2>No terms yet</h2>
    <p>Add the current semester before members can see points for it.</p>
  </section>
<% end %>

<p class="quiet">Changing a term's dates reassigns events in the old and new ranges. Review member totals before and after a change. Terms cannot overlap.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Back to officer dashboard", officer_root_path, class: "text-link" %></p>
